 the state of these seven Jolt capability groups. This change adds methods to PhysicsServer3D for setting, reading, and discovering extra properties, with implementations for scalar, bend, lra, vertex, volume, skin, and rod.   \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n1.Adds three APIs:                                                       \r\n     - soft_body_set_extra_property                                       \r\n     - soft_body_get_extra_property                                       \r\n     - soft_body_get_extra_property_list  \r\n2.Includes the Jolt implementation, backend and thread forwarding, API documentation, and native tests. \r\n3.GodotPhysics3D warns when these APIs are unsupported, while preserving their existing return values.\r\n4.Does not add configuration controls to the SoftBody3D Inspector.\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-14T10:20:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T10:23:22Z","closed_at":"2026-09-14T10:22:55Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9b7c45f5cb00b2e2ac7dff9ab54e1e83fbd5ff19","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ctuyu:soft-body-integration","ref":"soft-body-integration","repo":{"id":1362346484,"node_id":"R_kgDOUTPB9A","name":"godot","full_name":"ctuyu/godot","owner":{"login":"ctuyu","id":58906761,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTA2NzYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58906761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctuyu","html_url":"https://github.com/ctuyu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctuyu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctuyu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctuyu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_ur